{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seth Slays Everybody</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense roguelike where you're a god trapped in a guillotine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seth, the god of chaos, has been captured by Horus and is now stuck in a holy guillotine in the middle of the desert. But that won't stop you from killing <i>everyone</i>! Place deadly traps, cast divine powers, and curse treasures to wipe out wave after wave of Horus' minions\u2014and turn the sand into a bloodbath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blends the classic Plant vs Zombies style with roguelike progression where every run is different. Build insane combos focused on Seth, Egyptian traps, or cursed treasures. Travel across a Slay the Spire-style map and survive long enough to reach Horus, kick his feathered butt, and reclaim your divine body!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose? Horus kicks <i>your</i> butt. And you come back\u2014angrier than ever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840370?t=1756215810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/a084f67f23d6a7e3b77c9b97803c00f6c58ec0fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756215810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/8a24089dd1edc579f84eec0c10e4f0b0b9fcd095/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756215810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/8a24089dd1edc579f84eec0c10e4f0b0b9fcd095/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756215810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains fantasy violence with weapons and melee combat, along with cartoonish blood. There is occasional inappropriate language and some dark themes. There is no explicit nudity or sexual content, but some outfits and characters may be considered suggestive.\r\nNot recommended for children under 12."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seth Slays Everybody</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense roguelike where you're a god trapped in a guillotine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seth, the god of chaos, has been captured by Horus and is now stuck in a holy guillotine in the middle of the desert. But that won't stop you from killing <i>everyone</i>! Place deadly traps, cast divine powers, and curse treasures to wipe out wave after wave of Horus' minions\u2014and turn the sand into a bloodbath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blends the classic Plant vs Zombies style with roguelike progression where every run is different. Build insane combos focused on Seth, Egyptian traps, or cursed treasures. Travel across a Slay the Spire-style map and survive long enough to reach Horus, kick his feathered butt, and reclaim your divine body!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose? Horus kicks <i>your</i> butt. And you come back\u2014angrier than ever.</p>","developers":["Candeia Studio"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Gabriel Garcia Jerico ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/9d21dca37ea76e031c06a7a1aecd372883262fd1/header.jpg?t=1756215810","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840370/362052819/0aa8d915cd211491dbd6554cb4801a7f5d43ca19/1751561011/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751571845","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840370/362052819/0aa8d915cd211491dbd6554cb4801a7f5d43ca19/1751561011/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751571845","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840370/362052819/0aa8d915cd211491dbd6554cb4801a7f5d43ca19/1751561011/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751571845","id":257164970,"name":"SETH SLAYS EVERYBODY CHEGANDO","thumbnail":"https://